  "scopeDecisions": {
    "attachment": "Opt in by anchor producer and ground field skill. An explicit anchored cast binds the field to the exact live anchor and owner generation.",
    "movement": "Anchor recast updates the field center in the same input. The field keeps its original warning, tick clock, contact history, lifetime, ownership and capacity slot.",
    "cleanup": "An expiring or replaced anchor ends its attached fields with anchor_invalid before they can resolve another pulse. Ordinary source and world cleanup remain authoritative.",
    "publication": "Validate same-frame anchor identity, owner and center. Restore current binding and contact history across reconnect.",
